{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":68386534,"ns":0,"title":"Action type approach","extract":"The action type approach is a series of mental exercises—variously described as \"pseudoscientific\", \"empirically challenged\", or a \"neuromyth\"— that purport to increase physical performance in athletes.","description":"Pseudoscientific mental exercises","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}